          "help_en": "Encoding type. There are multiple ways to obtain the user identifier for Tmall Genie, and each method corresponds to a different encoding type.\n\n`PACKAGE_NAME`: APK package name, used as the encoding type for the Android application customer link.  \n`SKILL_ID`: Skill ID, used as the encoding type for the cloud-based link",
          "help_zh": "编码类型，获取天猫精灵的用户标识的途径有多种，不同途径对应不同的编码类型。\n\n`PACKAGE_NAME：`apk包名，Android应用客户链路的编码类型。\n`SKILL_ID`：技能ID，云端链路的编码类型",
          "name": "encode_type",
          "options": [
            "--encode-type"
          ],
          "raw_name": "EncodeType",
          "required": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "example": "123",
          "help_en": "Value corresponding to the encoding type.\n\nWhen the encoding type is `SKILL_ID`, the value is the application's Skill ID.  \nWhen the encoding type is `PACKAGE_NAME`, the value is the packageName of the corresponding client app",
          "help_zh": "编码类型对应的值\n\n编码类型是`SKILL_ID`时，其值为应用的Skill ID。\n编码类型是`PACKAGE_NAME`时，其值为对应客户端App的packageName",
          "name": "encode_key",
          "options": [
            "--encode-key"
          ],
          "raw_name": "EncodeKey",
          "required": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
